<h3>Example 1: E-commerce Product Page</h3>
<p>A React-based store that fetches price, stock, and description from an API after the initial shell loads.</p>
<pre><code>config = RenderConfig(
    url="https://example-store.com/products/chair-123",
    strategy=ReadinessStrategy.SELECTOR,
    selector="[data-product-price]",
    timeout_ms=15000,
